---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const mailClass =
  'text-foreground underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-accent';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms and Conditions — Henry Calligraphy"
  description="Terms and conditions for using the Henry Calligraphy website and commissioning bespoke calligraphy services."
>
  <section class="border-b border-foreground/15">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-24">
      <p class="font-sans text-[0.6rem] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-muted-foreground">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="mt-5 font-serif text-3xl leading-tight md:text-5xl">Terms and Conditions</h1>
      <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-lg text-foreground">1. Introduction</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            These Terms and Conditions apply to your use of the Henry Calligraphy website and to any
            bespoke calligraphy, engraving, hot foil, or related services you commission from Henry
            Calligraphy. By using this website or placing an order, you agree to these terms.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-lg text-foreground">2. Orders and quotes</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            All commissions are bespoke and begin with an enquiry. A final quote is provided based
            on the details of your project, including materials, quantity, complexity, and
            turnaround time. Quotes are valid for 14 days unless otherwise stated.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-lg text-foreground">3. Payment</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            A deposit may be required to confirm your booking or commission. Full payment terms will
            be outlined in your quote or invoice. Work on custom pieces begins once the agreed
            deposit or payment has been received.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-lg text-foreground">4. Cancellations and refunds</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Because each item is made to order, cancellations and refunds are not guaranteed. If you
            need to cancel or amend an order, please contact us as soon as possible. Any refund or
            partial credit will be considered on a case-by-case basis and at our discretion.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-lg text-foreground">5. Turnaround and delivery</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Turnaround times are estimates and depend on project scope, material availability, and
            current workload. We will communicate expected timelines clearly and keep you informed
            of any changes. Delivery costs and methods are agreed before final payment.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-lg text-foreground">6. Intellectual property</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            All calligraphy, designs, photographs, and content on this website are the property of
            Henry Calligraphy unless otherwise credited. Commissioned artwork is for personal or
            event use as agreed; commercial reproduction or resale without written permission is not
            allowed.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-lg text-foreground">7. Liability</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Henry Calligraphy takes great care in creating and packing every piece. Our liability is
            limited to the value of the commissioned work. We are not liable for delays or issues
            caused by circumstances beyond our reasonable control.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-lg text-foreground">8. Changes to these terms</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We may update these Terms and Conditions from time to time. The latest version will
            always be published on this page. Continued use of the website or our services after
            changes means you accept the updated terms.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-lg text-foreground">9. Contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            For questions about these Terms and Conditions, please email <a
              href="mailto:info@henrycalligraphy.com"
              class={mailClass}>info@henrycalligraphy.com</a
            >.
          </p>
        </section>
        <p class="pt-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground/70">Last updated: 4 September 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
